9
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,920
OK, I'll go first.

10
00:01:54,079 --> 00:01:54,920
Let's go home.

11
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,200
Go home.

12
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,360
In the blink of an eye,

13
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:06,680
