20
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:19,439
Mr. Wang, how about your side?

21
00:05:19,439 --> 00:05:20,480
The monthly quiz is coming up.

22
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,879
Students should

23
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:23,120
balance their

24
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,319
