27
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:29,480
Don't worry, sir.

28
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:34,079
What are you nodding for?

29
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,600
Are you talking

30
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,040
about our basketball club?

31
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,000
How are the students

32
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:40,920
doing lately?

33
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:42,879
Everything's good, sir.

34
00:05:42,879 --> 00:05:44,439
The friendly match is coming up.

35
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,160
Don't let it interfere with your study.

36
00:05:51,439 --> 00:05:53,439
Gu Chenyang, you're the shooting guard.

37
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,480
You're responsible for the pace of the game.

38
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,040
Are you ready?

39
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:01,120
Zhou Yang, power forward.

40
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:02,439
The foundation of the team.

41
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,399
Yes, sir.

42
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:06,279
What about you?

43
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:07,560
Lin Qingyuan, point guard.

44
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,800
Li Haoyu, shooting guard.

45
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,959
No problem.

46
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:13,920
Xu Anbo, are you ready?

47
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:14,920
Xu Anbo,

48
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,639
your vision

49
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:17,120
and hand-eye coordination

50
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:17,959
make you fit for center.

51
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:18,759
Okay.

52
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,199
This is our first

53
00:06:22,199 --> 00:06:23,000
friendly match.

54
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,399
Yibei,

55
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,959
