56
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,120
[Welcome to the inter-school]

57
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,439
[basketball friendly match.]

58
00:06:36,439 --> 00:06:37,199
[Today's competitors]

59
00:06:37,199 --> 00:06:38,160
[are]

60
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,360
[Yibei High School's team]

61
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,920
[and Shiyan No. 1 High School's team.]

62
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,800
[I hope both teams give their all]

63
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:44,120
to put on a

64
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,279
wonderful game for us.

65
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:48,720
Go for it!

66
00:06:50,199 --> 00:06:52,040
Go for it!

67
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:58,600
Yibei, go for it!

68
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:02,199
Stay focused!

69
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,560
Defense!

70
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:09,360
Go for it!

71
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:15,000
Yibei, go for it!

72
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,800
Nice shot!

73
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:36,160
No. 1 Middle School, go for it!

74
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:37,000
[Everyone,]

75
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,120
