76
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,279
[of the game between Yibei Middle School]

77
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:40,079
[and Qiming School.]

78
00:07:40,079 --> 00:07:42,000
[Qiming is currently in the lead.]

79
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,839
Go Qiming!

80
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:45,480
Quick pass!

81
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:50,360
Go!

82
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:53,199
Defense!

83
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:56,759
Go!

84
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:12,439
[No. 5 from Yibei, Zhou Yang,]

85
00:08:12,439 --> 00:08:13,519
[is a truly excellent]

86
00:08:13,519 --> 00:08:14,680
[blue-collar player.]

87
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,600
[Welcome back to the third quarter]

88
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,560
[of Yibei Middle School]

89
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:18,680
[versus the Experimental School.]

90
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:32,879
[Gu Chenyang,]

91
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:42,559
[No. 77 from Yibei Middle School,]

92
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,759
[hand foul.]

93
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:44,759
[Two free throws.]

94
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,559
[Fourth foul.]

95
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,759
Lin Qingyuan.

96
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:50,000
One more foul and he's out.

97
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,159
Be careful.

98
00:08:51,279 --> 00:08:52,159
No. 50 Li Haoyu

99
00:08:52,159 --> 00:08:53,799
and No. 77 Lin Qingyuan

100
00:08:53,799 --> 00:08:55,720
from Yibei Middle School

101
00:08:56,039 --> 00:08:57,840
have fouled four times.

102
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:58,519
They must be

103
00:08:58,519 --> 00:08:59,559
careful from now on.

104
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:25,120
This is the final quarter

105
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,200
of Yibei vs. Qiming.

106
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,159
[I must say,]

107
00:09:27,159 --> 00:09:28,000
[this game,]

108
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,919
[Gu Chenyang from Yibei]

109
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:30,559
[has really stepped up.]

110
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,080
[But it's been]

111
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,279
[a huge drain on him.]

112
00:10:30,039 --> 00:10:31,279
If you keep playing like this,

113
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,879
I honestly don't know

114
00:10:32,879 --> 00:10:34,200
if the team will be disbanded

115
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,159
or my internship

116
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:36,200
will end first.

117
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,200
Alright, you all must be tired.

118
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,320
Go get some rest.

119
00:10:42,759 --> 00:10:44,000
I'll go think about

120
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,480
how to keep the team going.

121
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,919
Goodbye, coach.

122
00:10:53,679 --> 00:10:54,399
Gu Chenyang,

123
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,240
I've been training

124
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,360
the way you taught me for a long time.

125
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,480
Why can't I still make the three-pointer?

126
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,639
You need to keep practicing.

127
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,320
I can't practice anymore.

128
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,559
I practice every day after finishing my homework,

129
00:11:08,039 --> 00:11:09,600
and even lift dumbbells.

130
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:11,919
I can't even pick up

131
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:12,840
beef balls when I eat.

132
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,240
You just ate less.

133
00:11:15,559 --> 00:11:16,759
I practice every day

134
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:17,879
and don't have time to go out

135
00:11:17,879 --> 00:11:18,960
with my buddies.

136
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,799
I'm too busy paying bills.

137
00:11:25,039 --> 00:11:25,559
Friendly games

138
00:11:25,559 --> 00:11:27,240
are just to let us find problems.

139
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,440
and we need more time to cooperate.

140
00:11:29,879 --> 00:11:30,600
So when I'm done

141
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,600
with the Student Union,

142
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:32,679
I'll talk to Gu Chenyang

143
00:11:32,679 --> 00:11:33,759
and figure out a solution.

144
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:34,919
So,

145
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:36,679
don't be discouraged.

146
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,840
Cheer up!

147
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,240
Gu Chenyang,

148
00:11:40,759 --> 00:11:42,240
you didn't say a word

149
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,360
and just left like that?

150
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,240
I have a tennis class later.

151
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,279
Tennis class?

152
00:11:57,799 --> 00:11:58,519
I thought

153
00:11:58,759 --> 00:12:00,240
you cared most about the basketball club.

154
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:01,759
It turns out

155
00:12:02,759 --> 00:12:04,159
we're just your backup.

156
00:12:09,639 --> 00:12:11,240
If you have the energy to complain here,

157
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,799
you might as well practice your dumbbells.

158
00:12:12,799 --> 00:12:14,480
I can tell from your shooting strength today

159
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,840
that you haven't practiced enough.

160
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,200
Alright, alright.

161
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,080
The captain has left.

162
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:23,840
Let's go.

163
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,279
How about having hot pot together?

164
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:31,759
Do you two want to go together?

165
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,240
So boring.

166
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,080
You are not lucky enough.

167
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,080
I'll go by myself.

168
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,240
Senior Zhou Yang

169
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,000
Is this the case

170
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,120
at the beginning of the basketball team?

171
00:12:46,039 --> 00:12:47,399
A loose sand.

172
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:52,399
As you said, it's just the beginning.

173
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:55,679
Let's clean up this bottle first.

174
00:13:20,039 --> 00:13:20,960
Today's game was lost,

175
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:22,039
and it's also my fault.

176
00:13:27,399 --> 00:13:28,639
Was my attitude towards them

177
00:13:28,639 --> 00:13:30,399
a bit too intense just now?

178
00:14:01,679 --> 00:14:03,480
Stop showing your little white teeth.

179
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:05,200
Your saliva is about to drip on my face.

180
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,840
You're just mean and sharp with me.

181
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:10,559
Why don't you

182
00:14:10,559 --> 00:14:11,559
treat others like this?

183
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:12,919
What are you doing here?

184
00:14:13,759 --> 00:14:15,399
Someone just finished playing tennis,

185
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,360
so he's gotta come back and practice basketball.

186
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,720
I'm just here to watch the fun.

187
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,639
Hello, Mom.

188
00:14:26,639 --> 00:14:27,559
[Son,]

189
00:14:27,559 --> 00:14:29,200
[why haven't you come home yet?]

190
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:32,440
I'm... I'm tutoring a classmate.

191
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,039
Gu Chenyang,

192
00:14:35,039 --> 00:14:36,200
I still don't get this problem.

193
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,480
Can you explain it to me again?

194
00:14:38,679 --> 00:14:40,320
Is that Li Haoyu?

195
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,440
Come on the phone.

196
00:14:47,159 --> 00:14:48,159
Hello, auntie.

197
00:14:48,159 --> 00:14:49,440
How do you know it's me?

198
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:50,639
Do you think I can't tell

199
00:14:50,639 --> 00:14:51,759
by your accent?

200
00:14:51,759 --> 00:14:53,440
You've been coming here

201
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,519
for half a month

202
00:14:54,519 --> 00:14:55,759
every summer vacation since elementary school.

203
00:14:55,759 --> 00:14:57,159
How could I not recognize your voice?

204
00:14:58,519 --> 00:14:59,440
Alright, alright.

205
00:14:59,879 --> 00:15:01,480
I'm relieved that you two are together.

206
00:15:01,799 --> 00:15:03,320
Take him to have a good time.

207
00:15:03,759 --> 00:15:04,320
I'm hanging up.

208
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,879
Okay. Goodbye, aunt.

209
00:15:23,159 --> 00:15:24,120
I didn't expect that aunt

210
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:25,360
still remembers my voice.

211
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,679
How could she not remember?

212
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:29,559
She likes you very much.

213
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,240
She said you are like her,

214
00:15:31,639 --> 00:15:32,399
both unreliable.

215
00:15:34,639 --> 00:15:35,320
By the way,

216
00:15:35,879 --> 00:15:36,639
How's your dad?

217
00:15:37,039 --> 00:15:37,639
Is he still

218
00:15:37,639 --> 00:15:38,679
nagging you?

219
00:15:42,919 --> 00:15:45,080
I should thank you.

220
00:15:45,519 --> 00:15:46,960
I haven't told my family

221
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,600
about my basketball team.

222
00:15:50,399 --> 00:15:51,679
How long do you plan to keep it a secret?

223
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:54,600
I'll wait until my dad comes back.

224
00:15:55,039 --> 00:15:57,000
After all, our team has been losing lately.

225
00:15:57,399 --> 00:15:58,399
It's not the right time.

226
00:16:03,799 --> 00:16:04,879
Actually, I just

227
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,120
wanted to take a break

228
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,279
and think about

229
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,120
how to

230
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,720
solve the problem of the basketball team.

231
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:19,440
I think

232
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,120
you should solve

233
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,279
your own problem first.

234
00:16:21,919 --> 00:16:23,120
Don't you want to go home?

235
00:16:23,799 --> 00:16:25,000
No one cares about me at home.

236
00:16:27,799 --> 00:16:29,120
What are you doing here?

237
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:32,919
Where did you come from?

238
00:16:33,679 --> 00:16:34,519
Didn't you go

239
00:16:34,519 --> 00:16:35,840
for hot pot alone?

240
00:16:36,159 --> 00:16:37,399
We've been losing,

241
00:16:37,399 --> 00:16:39,080
who's in the mood to eat alone?

242
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:41,120
Should we...

243
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:42,919
Perfect timing.

244
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,279
Let's go, I've got this.

245
00:16:55,279 --> 00:16:56,200
So this is

246
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:58,240
what you've got?

247
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,960
a bunch of people eating instant noodles?

248
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,039
What a vibe!

249
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,359
Why hasn't Xu Anbo come yet?

250
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,440
His family of four eats well.

251
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,400
They don't care about this.

252
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,920
Instant noodles are also good.

253
00:17:15,839 --> 00:17:16,720
Who you eat with

254
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:17,839
is more important than what you eat.

255
00:17:18,119 --> 00:17:19,079
You know me.

256
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:21,480
Let's eat.

257
00:17:30,119 --> 00:17:31,039
Yummy.

258
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:33,119
Didn't you just complain?

259
00:17:33,519 --> 00:17:34,839
That was then.

260
00:17:34,839 --> 00:17:36,160
This is now.

261
00:17:36,799 --> 00:17:38,680
Cut the chatter. Dig in.

262
00:17:43,559 --> 00:17:44,000
Hello?

263
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,079
[Your delivery has arrived.]

264
00:17:45,079 --> 00:17:45,920
Coming.

265
00:17:47,319 --> 00:17:48,119
Where is he going?

266
00:17:48,119 --> 00:17:48,759
No idea.

267
00:17:51,519 --> 00:17:52,799
Why do you take it?

268
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,599
He doesn't eat

269
00:17:54,599 --> 00:17:55,599
junk food like this.

270
00:17:55,599 --> 00:17:57,319
I'll eat it. Don't worry.

271
00:18:05,839 --> 00:18:07,880
Gu Chenyang, you've changed.

272
00:18:08,039 --> 00:18:09,599
You really start eating junk food.

273
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,279
I don't know what you like to eat,

274
00:18:11,279 --> 00:18:12,440
so I order some for you.

275
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:13,960
As the team leader,

276
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:16,039
this is my first time treating you to dinner.

277
00:18:16,839 --> 00:18:18,039
I shouldn't have

278
00:18:18,039 --> 00:18:19,640
left early this afternoon.

279
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:20,880
I'm sorry.

280
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:24,799
I accept Gu Chenyang's apology.

281
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:25,839
What about you?

282
00:18:26,319 --> 00:18:27,519
We must accept it.

283
00:18:27,519 --> 00:18:28,920
I accept it for Xu Anbo, too.

284
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:33,440
Cheers.

285
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,759
Come on.

286
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:44,640
Xu Anbo didn't come.

287
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:45,960
What a pity!

288
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,880
Wait until later.

289
00:18:48,440 --> 00:18:49,400
What?

290
00:18:50,079 --> 00:18:51,440
The most important thing

291
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,680
in my secret base is

292
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:53,279
eating,

